# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""

    mslib.index
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~

    shows some docs on the root url of the server

    This file is part of mss.

    :copyright: Copyright 2020 Reimar Bauer
    :copyright: Copyright 2020-2023 by the MSS team, see AUTHORS.
